infra/pulumi/.pulumi
# Pulumi stack configs are intentionally tracked — secret values inside
# (`secure: AAA...` blobs) are encrypted by Pulumi cloud, so committing
# them is safe and lets a fresh checkout reach `pulumi up` parity. Only
# editor/CLI backup files stay out.
infra/pulumi/Pulumi.*.yaml.bak
